  "details": "This bug has been in the game since it launched on the Quest, sometimes for no apparent reason, the microphone will go from transmitting my sexy voice to just pops and clicks.\n\nOnce someone informs you of this travesty, you can fix it by muting yourself and then unmuting. I’ve only seen it with quest users, (none seem to be immune) and I’ve recently been told it happens to RiftS owners too.\n\nPlease fix this, it’s epically annoying.",
